<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Advanced Micro EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Advanced Micro EPS view cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said analyst Scott Randall lowered his earnings estimates on Advanced Micro Devices Inc for fiscal 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1997 estimate to $0.83 per share from $1.34.</p>
<p>-- Cut 1998 estimate to $2.92 per share from $3.42.</p>
<p>-- Kept short- and long-term hold ratings.</p>
<p>-- Late Tuesday, Advanced Micro reported lower than expected second quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/4 to 38-3/8.</p>
</text>
